><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p
>Notify the office in<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part 4.</span
> so each beneficiary can obtain a visa or be admitted.¬† (<span style="font-weight:bold"
>NOTE:<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
></span
>A petition is not required for E-1, E-2, E-3, H-1B1 Chile/Singapore, or TN visa beneficiaries.)</p
