>H Classification Supplement to Form I-1 29. Section 2.¬†Complete This Section If Filing for H-2 A or H-2 B Classification. 7. If you answered ‚ÄúYes,‚Äù to Item Number 6., list the name and address(es) of all such persons and entities regardless of whether you have a direct or indirect contractual relationship, and whether such person or entity is located inside or outside the United States or is a governmental or quasi-governmental entity.  If you need to include the name and address of more than one person or entity, use the space provided in Part 9. Additional Information.  Address of Agent, Facilitator, Recruiter, or Similar Employment Service. Enter ZIP Code.</toolTip
></assist
><event activity="change" name="event__change"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript" runAt="both"
>// allows 0-9, 
var regex = /[^0-9]/
if(regex.test(xfa.event.change)) {
  xfa.event.change = "";
  xfa.host.messageBox("Enter 5-digit Zip Code.");
}
</script
></event
><event activity="exit" name="event__exit"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript" runAt="both"
>
// this checks if 5-digit Zip Code is entered
if(this.rawValue != null)
{
if (this.rawValue.length != 5)
{		
	xfa.host.messageBox("Please enter 5 digit Zip Code.");
	xfa.host.setFocus(this.somExpression);
	this.rawValue="";	
}
}

xfa.host.messageBox("Please visit https://tools.usps.com/go/ZipLookupAction_input to check that you have entered the full address as recognized by USPS, using standard abbreviations and formatting.", "", 3);
</script
></event
