><?renderCache.bounds 538560 18000 0 0 1440 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 78 Section 2.¬† Complete This Section If Filing for H-2A or H-2B Classification   0 3600 12410 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 12000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 11 (continued) 0 391245 12410 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 12000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
