><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p
>The petitioner must execute<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part A.</span
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If the petitioner is the employer's agent, the employer must execute<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part B.</span
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If there are joint employers, they must each execute<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part C.</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para vAlign="middle" spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"
/><assist
><speak
>For H-2 A petitioners only. The petitioner agrees to pay 10 dollars in liquidated damages for each instance where it cannot demonstrate it is in compliance with the notification requirement.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText229[25]"
/></traversal
