>H Classification Supplement to Form I-1 29. Section 2.¬†Complete This Section If Filing for H-2 A or H-2 B Classification. Part A.¬†Petitioner. By filing this petition, I agree to the conditions of H-2 A/H-2 B employment and agree to the notification requirements. For H-2 A petitioners: I also agree to the liquidated damages requirements defined in 8 Code of Federal Regulations 2 14.2(h)(5)(vi)(B)(3). Enter Date of Signature as 2-digit Month, 2-digit Day, and 4-digit Year.</toolTip
></assist
><para vAlign="middle"
/><event activity="change" name="event__change"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript" runAt="both"
>
// allows -0-9, and /
var regex = /[^0-9\/]/
if(regex.test(xfa.event.change) || xfa.event.newText.length &gt; 10) {
  xfa.event.change = "";
  xfa.host.messageBox("Enter numeric and slash characters only.");
}
</script
></event
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText229[30]"
/></traversal
><event activity="exit" name="event__exit"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript"
>
//Date Validation on Exit
if (this.rawValue == this.formattedValue)
{
	xfa.host.messageBox("Please enter 2 digit month, 2 digit day and 4 digit year.");
	xfa.host.setFocus(this.somExpression);
	this.rawValue="";
}
</script
></event
