><value
><text
>By filing this petition, I agree to the conditions of H-2A/H-2B employment, agree to fully cooperate with any compliance review, evaluation, verification, or inspection conducted by USCIS, and agree to the notification requirements.  For H-2A petitioners:  I also agree to the liquidated damages requirements defined in 8 CFR 214.2(h)(5)(vi)(B)(3).</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
