><text
>I certify that I have authorized the party filing this petition to act as my agent in this regard.  I assume full responsibility for all representations made by this agent on my behalf and agree to the conditions of H-2A/H-2B eligibility.  I agree to fully cooperate with any compliance review, evaluation, verification, or inspection conducted by USCIS.  </text
></value
