><assist role="H1"
><speak
>Section 3.¬†Complete This Section If Filing for H-3 Classification</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText118[35]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 538560 18000 0 0 1440 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 68 Section 3.¬†  Complete This Section If Filing for H-3 Classification 0 3600 12410 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 12000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="27.517mm" w="135.466mm" h="6.35mm"
><value
><text
>Is the training you intend to provide, or similar training, available in the beneficiary's country?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line1a_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 383998 18000 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 99 Is the training you intend to provide, or similar training, available in the beneficiary's country? 0 0 11842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="35.983mm" w="104.91mm" h="6.35mm"
><value
><text
>Will the training benefit the beneficiary in pursuing a career abroad?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line1b_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 297383 18000 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 70 Will the training benefit the beneficiary in pursuing a career abroad? 0 0 11842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="44.45mm" w="141.817mm" h="8.579mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html" maxLength="0"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="letter-spacing:0in"
>Does the training involve productive employment incidental to the training?<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If yes, explain the amount of compensation employment versus the classroom in<span style="font-weight:bold"
> Part 9. of Form I-129.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="0pt"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line1c_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="55.033mm" w="105.159mm" h="6.35mm"
><value
><text
>Does the beneficiary already have skills related to the training?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line1d_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 298089 18000 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 65 Does the beneficiary already have skills related to the training? 0 0 11842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="63.5mm" w="3.588458in" h="6.35mm"
><value
><text
>Is this training an effort to overcome a labor shortage?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line1e_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 258369 18000 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 56 Is this training an effort to overcome a labor shortage? 0 0 11842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw name="FFText219" x="14.818mm" y="71.967mm" w="4.534875in" h="6.35mm"
><value
><text
>Do you intend to employ the beneficiary abroad at the end of this training?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="HSec3Line7_Check[1]"
