><draw h="8.467mm" name="FFText92" w="146.05mm" x="6.351mm" y="52.917mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html" maxLength="0"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>3.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Are you a nonprofit research organization or a governmental research organization, as defined in 8 CFR 214.2(h)(19)(iii)(C)?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="-24pt"
/><assist
><speak
>3. Are you a nonprofit research organization or a governmental research organization, as defined in 8 Code of Federal Regulations 2 14.2(H)(19)(I I I)(C)?</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line3_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="7.761mm" name="FFText92" w="154.517mm" x="6.351mm" y="63.5mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>4.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Is this the second or subsequent request for an extension of stay that this petitioner has filed for this alien?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="-24pt" vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line4_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="6.35mm" name="FFText92" w="150.162mm" x="6.352mm" y="74.083mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>5.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Is this an amended petition that does not contain any request for extensions of stay?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle" textIndent="-19pt"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line5_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="8.555mm" name="FFText92" w="154.517mm" x="6.351mm" y="99.483mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>8.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Is the petitioner a nonprofit entity that engages in an established curriculum-related clinical training of students registered at such an institution?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="-24pt"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line8_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="6.35mm" name="FFText92" w="146.579167mm" x="6.351mm" y="82.55mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>6.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Are you filing this petition to correct a USCIS error?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><assist
><speak
>6. Are you filing this petition to correct a U S C I S error?</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line6_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="6.35mm" name="FFText92" w="146.579167mm" x="6.351mm" y="91.017mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>7.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Is the petitioner a primary or secondary education institution?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para vAlign="middle"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line7_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="7.825mm" name="FFText59" w="190.5mm" x="6.351mm" y="109.916mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="letter-spacing:0in"
>If you answered yes to any of the questions above, you are not required to submit the ACWIA fee for your H-1B Form I-129 petition.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If you answered no to all questions, answer<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Item Number 9.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>below.</p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"
/><assist
><speak
>If you answered yes to any of the questions above, you are not required to submit the American Competitiveness and Workforce Improvement Act (A C W I A)  fee for your H-1B Form I-1 29 petition. If you answered no to all questions, answer Item Number 9. below.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText92[6]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="8.287mm" name="FFText92" w="154.517mm" x="6.351mm" y="120.65mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"
>9.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
>Do you currently employ a total of 25 or fewer full-time equivalent employees in the United States, including all affiliates or subsidiaries of this company/organization?</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="-24pt"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="H1BSec2Line9_Yes[0]"
/></traversal
