><assist
><toolTip
>H-1B and H-1B1 Data Collection and Filing Fee Exemption Supplement. Section 2. Fee Exemption and/or Determination. In order for U S C I S to determine if you must pay the additional 1,500 dollar or 750 dollar American Competitiveness and Workforce Improvement Act (A C W I A) fee, answer all of the following questions. 3. Are you a nonprofit research organization or a governmental research organization, as defined in 8 Code of Federal Regulations 2 14.2(H)(19)(I I I)(C)? Check Yes.</toolTip
