><draw name="FFText118" w="190.5mm" x="6.351mm" y="141.667mm" h="17.083mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="letter-spacing:0in"
>NOTE:<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>A petitioner seeking initial approval of H-1B nonimmigrant status for a beneficiary, or seeking approval to employ an H-1B nonimmigrant currently working for another employer, must submit an additional<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$500<span style="font-weight:normal"
> Fraud Prevention and Detection fee.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>An additional fee of<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$4,000<span style="font-weight:normal"
> must be submitted if you responded yes to<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>Item Numbers 1.d. and 1.d.1. of Section 1.<span style="font-weight:normal"
> of this supplement.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>This<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$4,000<span style="font-weight:normal"
> fee was mandated by the provisions of Public Law 114-113.</span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" weight="bold" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para textIndent="0pt" spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt" vAlign="middle"
/><assist
><speak
>Note: A petitioner seeking initial approval of H-1B nonimmigrant status for a beneficiary, or seeking approval to employ an H-1B nonimmigrant currently working for another employer, must submit an additional 500 dollar Fraud Prevention and Detection fee. For petitions filed before October 1, 2015, an additional fee of 2,000 dollars must be submitted if you responded yes to Item Numbers 1. D. and 1. D. 1. of Section 1 of this supplement. This 2,000 dollar fee was mandated by the provisions of Public Law 1 11 through 2 30, as amended by Public Law 1 11 through 3 47.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText59[2]"
/></traversal
></draw
><draw h="12.7mm" name="FFText59" w="190.5mm" x="6.351mm" y="160.867mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p
>The Fraud Prevention and Detection Fee and Public Law 114-113 fee do not apply to H-1B1 petitions.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>These fees, when applicable, may not be waived.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
></span
>You must include payment of the fees when you submit this form.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Failure to submit the fees when required will result in rejection or denial of your submission.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Each of these fees should be paid by separate checks or money orders.</p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt" vAlign="middle"
/><border
><edge presence="hidden"
/></border
><assist
><speak
>The Fraud Prevention and Detection Fee and the Public Law 1 11 through 2 30 fee do not apply to H-1B1 petitions.  These fees, when applicable, may not be waived.  You must include payment of the fee or fees when you submit this form.  Failure to submit the fee or fees when required will result in rejection or denial of your submission. Each of these fee or fees should be paid by separate checks or money orders.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="Text1[78]"
/></traversal
