>H-1B and H-1B1 Data Collection and Filing Fee Exemption Supplement. Section 3. Numerical Limitation Information. 3. If you answered Item Number 1. B. "Cap H-1B U. S. Master's Degree or Higher," provide the following information regarding the master's or higher degree the beneficiary has earned from a U. S. institution as defined in 20 United States Code 10 0 1(A): B. Enter Date Degree Awarded as 2-digit Month, 2-digit Day, and 4-digit Year.</toolTip
