>¬†¬†¬†¬†¬†¬† </span
><span style="font-weight:normal"
>List the beneficiary's and any dependent family member's prior periods of stay in an H or L classification in the United States for the last seven years.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Be sure to list only those periods in which the beneficiary and/or family members were physically present in the U.S. in an H or L classification.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Do not include periods in which the beneficiary was in a dependent status, for example, H-4 or L-2 status.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If more space is needed, go to<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>Part 9.<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>of Form I-129<span style="font-weight:normal"
>.</span
></p
></body
></exData
