><draw name="FFText118" x="6.35mm" y="118.533mm" w="190.5mm" h="4.233mm"
><value
><text
>If you are seeking L-1B specialized knowledge status for an individual, answer the following question:</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" weight="bold"
/><para lineHeight="12.744pt" vAlign="middle"
/><assist
><speak
>If you are seeking L-1 B specialized knowledge status for an individual, answer the following question:</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText1[325]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 540000 11999 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 102 If you are seeking L-1B specialized knowledge status for an individual, answer the following question: 0 0 8841 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw h="8.465mm" name="FFText324" w="182.033mm" x="14.817mm" y="124.883mm"
><value
><text
>Will the beneficiary be stationed primarily offsite (at the worksite of an employer other than the petitioner or its affiliate, subsidiary, or parent)?</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para textIndent="0pt"
/><traversal
><traverse ref="LSec1Line12[1]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 515999 23995 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 128 Will the beneficiary be stationed primarily offsite (at the worksite of an employer other than the petitioner or its affiliate,  0 0 7842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 23 subsidiary, or parent)? 0 0 19842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw h="13.018mm" name="FFText324" w="182.033mm" x="14.817mm" y="141.642mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="letter-spacing:0in"
>If you answered yes to the preceding question, describe how and by whom the beneficiary's work will be controlled and supervised.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Include a description of the amount of time each supervisor is expected to control and supervise the work.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If you need additional space to respond to this question, proceed to<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part 9.</span
> of the Form I-129, and type or print your explanation.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman"
/><para marginLeft="2pt"
/><assist
><speak
>If you answered yes to the preceding question, describe how and by whom the beneficiary's work will be controlled and supervised. Include a description of the amount of time each supervisor is expected to control and supervise the work. If you need additional space to respond to this question, proceed to Part 9. of the Form I-1 29, and type or print your explanation.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="Line3_JobDescription[5]"
/></traversal
