><p style="letter-spacing:0in"
>If you answered yes to the preceding question, describe the reasons why placement at another worksite outside the petitioner, subsidiary, affiliate, or parent is needed.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Include a description of how the beneficiary's duties at another worksite relate to the need for the specialized knowledge he or she possesses.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>If you need additional space to respond to this question, proceed to<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:bold"
>Part 9.</span
> of the Form I-129, and type or print your explanation.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
></p
></body
></exData
