><value
><text
>Section 3.¬†¬†¬†Additional Fees</text
></value
><font typeface="Times New Roman" weight="bold" baselineShift="0pt" size="12pt"
/><margin topInset="0mm" bottomInset="0mm" leftInset="0.508mm" rightInset="0mm"
/><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="-46.08pt" marginLeft="2.16pt" marginRight="0pt" vAlign="middle"
/><border
><edge thickness="0.254mm"
/><corner thickness="0.254mm"
/><fill
><color value="226,226,226"
/></fill
></border
><assist role="H1"
><speak
>Section 3.¬†Additional Fees</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText329[1]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 538560 18000 0 0 1440 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 31 Section 3.¬†¬†¬†Additional Fees 0 3600 12410 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 12000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw h="21.166mm" name="FFText329" w="190.5mm" x="6.35mm" y="129.117mm"
><value
><exData contentType="text/html" maxLength="0"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold"
>NOTE:<span style="font-weight:normal"
><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>A petitioner that seeks initial approval of L nonimmigrant status for a beneficiary, or seeks approval to employ an L nonimmigrant currently working for another employer, must submit an additional<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$500<span style="font-weight:normal"
> Fraud Prevention and Detection fee.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>For petitions filed on or after December 18, 2015, you must submit an additional fee of<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$4,500<span style="font-weight:normal"
> if you responded yes to both questions in<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>Item Numbers 4.a.<span style="font-weight:normal"
> and<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>4.b.<span style="font-weight:normal"
> on the first page of this L Classification Supplement.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>This<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
>$4,500<span style="font-weight:normal"
> fee is mandated by the provisions of Public Law 114-113.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"
/><border
><edge presence="hidden"
/></border
><assist
><speak
>NOTE: A petitioner that seeks initial approval of L nonimmigrant status for a beneficiary, or seeks approval to employ an L nonimmigrant currently working for another employer, must submit an additional 500 dollar Fraud Prevention and Detection fee. For petitions filed before October 1, 2015, you must submit an additional fee of 2,250 dollars if you responded yes to both questions in Item Numbers 4. A. and 4. B. on the first page of this L Classification Supplement. This 2,250 dollar fee is mandated by the provisions of Public Law 1 11 through 2 30, as amended by Public Law 1 11 through 3 47.</speak
></assist
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText329[2]"
/></traversal
><?renderCache.bounds 540000 59998 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 5 NOTE: 0 0 7842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 120   A petitioner that seeks initial approval of L nonimmigrant status for a beneficiary, or seeks approval to employ an L  0 31670 7842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 79 nonimmigrant currently working for another employer, must submit an additional  0 0 19842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 4 $500 0 329097 19842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 42  Fraud Prevention and Detection fee.  For  0 349097 19842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 84 petitions filed on or after December 18, 2015, you must submit an additional fee of  0 0 31842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 6 $4,500 0 334639 31842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 43  if you responded yes to both questions in  0 362139 31842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 17 Item Numbers 4.a. 0 0 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 5  and  0 79434 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 4 4.b. 0 98872 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 62  on the first page of this L Classification Supplement.  This  0 114434 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 6 $4,500 0 353564 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 38  fee is mandated by the provisions of  0 381064 43842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 20 Public Law 114-113.  0 0 55842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
><draw h="12.636mm" name="FFText329" w="190.5mm" x="6.35mm" y="152.4mm"
><value
><exData maxLength="0" contentType="text/html"
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"
><p style="font-weight:bold"
>These fees, when applicable, may not be waived.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
><span style="font-weight:normal"
>You must include payment of the fees with your submission of this form.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Failure to submit the fees when required will result in rejection or denial of your submission.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬† </span
>Each of these fees should be paid by separate checks or money orders.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"
>¬†</span
></span
></p
></body
></exData
></value
><ui
><textEdit
><margin
/></textEdit
></ui
><font typeface="Times New Roman" baselineShift="0pt"
/><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"
/><border
><edge presence="hidden"
/></border
><assist
><speak
>These fees, when applicable, may not be waived. You must include payment of the fee or fees with your submission of this form. Failure to submit the fee or fees when required will result in rejection or denial of your submission. Each of these fee or fees should be paid by separate check or checks or money order or orders. </speak
></assist
><?renderCache.bounds 540000 35819 0 0 0 0 0 0?><?renderCache.textRun 48 These fees, when applicable, may not be waived.  0 0 7842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 1 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 81 You must include payment of the fees with your submission of this form.  Failure  0 207500 7842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 135 to submit the fees when required will result in rejection or denial of your submission.  Each of these fees should be paid by separate  0 0 19842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?><?renderCache.textRun 24 checks or money orders.  0 0 31842 0 0 0 "Times New Roman" 0 0 10000 ISO-8859-1?></draw
