>Q-1 Classification Supplement to Form I-1 29. Section 1. Complete if you are filing for a Q-1 International Cultural Exchange Alien. I hereby certify that the participant or participants in the international cultural exchange program: A. Is at least 18 years of age, B. Is qualified to perform the service or labor or receive the type of training stated in the petition, C. Has the ability to communicate effectively about the cultural attributes of his or her country of nationality to the American public, and D. Has resided and been physically present outside the United States for the immediate prior year.¬†Applies only if the participant was previously admitted as a Q-1. I also certify that I will offer the alien or aliens the same wages and working conditions comparable to those accorded local domestic workers similarly employed. 2. Signature and Date. Enter Date of Signature as 2-digit Month, 2-digit Day, and 4-digit Year.</toolTip
></assist
><border
><edge
/><corner thickness="0.176mm"
/></border
><validate scriptTest="warning" formatTest="error"
><message
><text name="formatTest"
/></message
></validate
><event activity="change" name="event__change"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript" runAt="both"
>// allows -0-9, and /
var regex = /[^0-9\/]/
if(regex.test(xfa.event.change) || xfa.event.newText.length &gt; 10) {
  xfa.event.change = "";
  xfa.host.messageBox("Enter numeric and slash characters only.");
}



</script
></event
><traversal
><traverse ref="FFText1[370]"
/></traversal
><event activity="exit" name="event__exit"
><script contentType="application/x-javascript"
>
//Date Validation on Exit
if (this.rawValue == this.formattedValue)
{
	xfa.host.messageBox("Please enter 2 digit month, 2 digit day and 4 digit year.");
	xfa.host.setFocus(this.somExpression);
	this.rawValue="";
}
</script
></event
></field
