><speak
>Part 5.¬†¬†Applicant's Statement, Contact Information, Acknowledgement of Appointment at USCIS Application Support Center, Certification, and Signature. NOTE:  Read the information on penalties in the Form I-90 instructions before completing this part.  You must file Form I-90 while in the United States. Applicant's Statement.  NOTE: Select the box for either Item Number 1. A. or 1. B.¬† If applicable, select the box for Item Number 2., 6 . A . Signature of Applicant.  This form can not be signed electronically.  The name of the applicant can not be typewritten into this space.</speak
></assist
